{"id": "swebq0107", "pool": "swebq", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "English is spoken in many countries around the world. It's an official language in more than 60 nations, including the United States, the United Kingdom, Canada, Australia, New Zealand, India, South Africa, and several Caribbean island s. You can also find it spoken in parts of Africa, Asia, and Europe due to historical connections with former British colonies or as a second language for international communication.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
