{"id": "swebq0155", "pool": "swebq", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Battle of Gettysburg was fought between the Union Army, led by General George Meade, and the Confederate Army, commanded by General Robert E. Lee. It took place from July 1st to July 3rd in 18 6 3 during the American Civil War.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
