{"id": "swebq0203", "pool": "swebq", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Atlanta is full of great things to do. You can visit the Martin Lu ther King Jr. National Historical Park, which honors his life and legacy. The High Museum of Art has amazing collections from all over the world, and you can explore some beautiful parks like Piedmont Park or the Atlanta Botanical Garden. If you love sports, catch a game at Mercedes- Benz Stadium or State Farm Arena. There are also cool neighborhoods like In man Park with great restaurants and shops, and don't miss the chance to see the city lights from the top of the Westin Peachtree Pla za.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 30, "carrier_ended": null}
